{"version":1,"id":"matematicas-2019-reserva-3","asignatura":"matematicas","anio":2019,"convocatoria":"Reserva 3","documento":"MAT-2019-RESERVA_3.pdf","ejercicios":[{"id":"matematicas-2019-reserva-3-1","n":1,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Según un determinado modelo, la concentración en sangre de cierto medicamento viene dada por la función \\(C(t)=te^{-t/2}\\) mg/ml, siendo \\(t\\) el tiempo en horas transcurridas desde que se le administra el medicamento al enfermo.","apartados":["(2 p.) Determina, si existe, el valor máximo absoluto de la función y en qué momento se alcanza.","(0,5 p.) Sabiendo que la máxima concentración sin peligro para el paciente es 1 mg/ml, señala si en algún momento del tratamiento hay riesgo para el paciente."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(C\\) está definida para \\(t\\ge0\\) (tiempo desde la administración)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Rayamos la parte de la recta que queda fuera del dominio: ahí la función no está definida y no se estudia.</i> y es derivable; no hay puntos «problemáticos». Estudiamos el signo de \\(C'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>.</p>\\[C'(t)=e^{-t/2}-\\frac t2e^{-t/2}=\\left(1-\\frac t2\\right)e^{-t/2}\\]\\[1-\\frac t2=0\\Rightarrow\\boxed{t=2}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 210 108' width='100%' style='max-width:252px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H196' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M14 56L18 48M18 56L22 48M22 56L26 48M26 56L30 48M30 56L34 48M34 56L38 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M40 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='40' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>0</text><path d='M114 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='114' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>2</text><text x='51.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M65.0 40L101.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M92.0 11L101.0 10L99.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='77.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>C</tspan>′(1) &gt; 0</text><text x='129.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M143.0 10L179.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M170.0 39L179.0 40L177.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='155.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>C</tspan>′(3) &lt; 0</text></svg></div><p>Luego \\(C\\) crece en \\((0,2)\\) debido a que \\(C'(t)\\gt0\\), y decrece en \\((2,+\\infty)\\) debido a que \\(C'(t)\\lt0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>. Alcanza un máximo en \\(t=2\\) de valor \\(C(2)=2e^{-1}=\\dfrac2e\\approx0{,}7358\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Hay un mínimo donde \\(f\\) pasa de decrecer a crecer y un máximo donde pasa de crecer a decrecer.</i>.</p><p>Es el máximo absoluto: \\(C\\) crece hasta \\(t=2\\) y decrece después, con \\(C(0)=0\\) y</p>\\[\\lim_{t\\to+\\infty}\\frac t{e^{t/2}}=\\left[\\frac\\infty\\infty\\right]\\overset{\\text{L'H}}=\\lim_{t\\to+\\infty}\\frac1{\\frac12e^{t/2}}=0\\]<div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 190' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='30.4,152.7 33.5,136.6 36.6,122.9 39.8,111.2 42.9,101.4 46.0,93.2 49.1,86.5 52.2,81.0 55.4,76.7 58.5,73.4 61.6,70.9 64.7,69.3 67.8,68.3 71.0,67.8 74.1,67.9 77.2,68.4 80.3,69.3 83.4,70.5 86.6,71.9 89.7,73.6 92.8,75.5 95.9,77.5 99.0,79.6 102.2,81.8 105.3,84.0 108.4,86.3 111.5,88.7 114.6,91.0 117.8,93.3 120.9,95.7 124.0,98.0 127.1,100.2 130.2,102.4 133.4,104.6 136.5,106.7 139.6,108.8 142.7,110.8 145.8,112.8 149.0,114.6 152.1,116.5 155.2,118.2 158.3,119.9 161.4,121.5 164.6,123.1 167.7,124.6 170.8,126.0 173.9,127.4 177.0,128.7 180.2,130.0 183.3,131.2 186.4,132.3 189.5,133.4 192.6,134.5 195.8,135.5 198.9,136.4 202.0,137.3 205.1,138.2 208.2,139.0 211.4,139.7 214.5,140.5 217.6,141.2 220.7,141.8 223.8,142.4 227.0,143.0 230.1,143.6 233.2,144.1 236.3,144.6 239.4,145.1 242.6,145.5 245.7,145.9 248.8,146.3 251.9,146.7 255.0,147.1 258.2,147.4 261.3,147.7 264.4,148.0 267.5,148.3 270.6,148.6 273.8,148.8 276.9,149.0 280.0,149.3' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='20.0' y1='37.3' x2='280.0' y2='37.3' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><circle cx='72.0' cy='67.8' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='78.0' y='61.8'>máx (2, 2/e)</text><text x='207.2' y='29.2' fill='#e8487a' font-size='10'>1 mg/ml</text><text x='228.0' y='129.6' fill='#2f6df0' font-size='10'>C(t)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 152.7H294.0M30.4 184.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='72.0' y1='149.7' x2='72.0' y2='155.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='69.0' y='166.7' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='113.6' y1='149.7' x2='113.6' y2='155.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='110.6' y='166.7' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='155.2' y1='149.7' x2='155.2' y2='155.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='152.2' y='166.7' font-size='10'>6</text><line x1='196.8' y1='149.7' x2='196.8' y2='155.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='193.8' y='166.7' font-size='10'>8</text><line x1='238.4' y1='149.7' x2='238.4' y2='155.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='235.4' y='166.7' font-size='10'>10</text><line x1='27.4' y1='95.0' x2='33.4' y2='95.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='14.4' y='99.0' font-size='10'>0.5</text><line x1='27.4' y1='37.3' x2='33.4' y2='37.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='14.4' y='41.3' font-size='10'>1</text></svg></div><div class='res'>El máximo absoluto se alcanza a las 2 horas y vale \\(\\dfrac2e\\approx0{,}7358\\) mg/ml</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>La concentración nunca supera su máximo absoluto, \\(\\frac2e\\approx0{,}74\\lt1\\) mg/ml.</p><div class='res'>En ningún momento hay riesgo para el paciente: la concentración máxima es \\(\\dfrac2e\\approx0{,}74\\) mg/ml, menor que 1 mg/ml</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"opt","apartados":"a, b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2019-RESERVA_3.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2019-reserva-3-2","n":2,"num":2,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Dado un número real \\(a\\gt0\\), considera la función \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\), dada por \\(f(x)=x^2-ax\\), y la recta \\(y=2ax\\). Determina \\(a\\) sabiendo que el área del recinto limitado por la gráfica de \\(f\\) y la recta anterior es 36.","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p><b>Puntos de corte</b> de la parábola y la recta:</p>\\[x^2-ax=2ax\\iff x^2-3ax=0\\iff x(x-3a)=0\\iff x=0\\ \\text{ o }\\ x=3a\\]<p>Entre \\(0\\) y \\(3a\\) la recta va por encima (en \\(x=a\\): recta \\(2a^2\\), parábola \\(0\\)). En el dibujo, el caso \\(a=2\\):</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 230' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='51.7,197.7 56.5,193.6 61.2,189.5 66.0,185.4 70.7,181.3 75.5,177.2 80.2,173.1 85.0,169.0 89.8,164.9 94.5,160.8 99.3,156.7 104.0,152.6 108.8,148.5 113.5,144.4 118.3,140.3 123.0,136.2 127.8,132.1 132.6,128.0 137.3,123.9 142.1,119.8 146.8,115.7 151.6,111.6 156.3,107.5 161.1,103.4 165.9,99.3 170.6,95.2 175.4,91.1 180.1,87.0 184.9,82.9 189.6,78.8 194.4,74.7 199.1,70.6 203.9,66.5 208.7,62.4 213.4,58.3 218.2,54.2 222.9,50.1 227.7,46.0 232.4,41.9 237.2,37.8 242.0,33.7 242.0,33.7 237.2,43.8 232.4,53.6 227.7,63.0 222.9,72.2 218.2,81.1 213.4,89.6 208.7,97.9 203.9,105.8 199.1,113.5 194.4,120.8 189.6,127.8 184.9,134.5 180.1,141.0 175.4,147.1 170.6,152.8 165.9,158.3 161.1,163.5 156.3,168.4 151.6,172.9 146.8,177.2 142.1,181.1 137.3,184.8 132.6,188.1 127.8,191.1 123.0,193.9 118.3,196.3 113.5,198.4 108.8,200.2 104.0,201.6 99.3,202.8 94.5,203.7 89.8,204.3 85.0,204.5 80.2,204.5 75.5,204.1 70.7,203.4 66.0,202.5 61.2,201.2 56.5,199.6 51.7,197.7' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='23.2,179.9 28.2,183.8 33.2,187.4 38.2,190.6 43.2,193.5 48.2,196.1 53.2,198.3 58.2,200.2 63.2,201.8 68.3,203.0 73.3,203.8 78.3,204.4 83.3,204.5 88.3,204.4 93.3,203.9 98.3,203.0 103.3,201.8 108.3,200.3 113.3,198.4 118.4,196.2 123.4,193.7 128.4,190.8 133.4,187.6 138.4,184.0 143.4,180.1 148.4,175.8 153.4,171.2 158.4,166.3 163.4,161.0 168.5,155.4 173.5,149.4 178.5,143.1 183.5,136.5 188.5,129.5 193.5,122.1 198.5,114.5 203.5,106.5 208.5,98.1 213.5,89.4 218.6,80.4 223.6,71.0 228.6,61.3 233.6,51.2 238.6,40.8 243.6,30.1 248.6,19.0 253.6,7.6 258.6,-4.2 263.6,-16.3 268.6,-28.7 273.7,-41.5' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='42.2,205.9 115.1,143.0 188.0,80.1 261.0,17.3' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='242.0' cy='33.7' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='172.0' y='29.7'>(3a, 6a²)</text><text x='248.3' y='102.0' fill='#f0a30a' font-size='10'>y = 2ax</text><text x='70.7' y='33.7' fill='#2f6df0' font-size='10'>f(x) = x² − ax</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 197.7H294.0M51.7 224.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='115.1' y1='194.7' x2='115.1' y2='200.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='112.1' y='211.7' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='178.5' y1='194.7' x2='178.5' y2='200.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='175.5' y='211.7' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='242.0' y1='194.7' x2='242.0' y2='200.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='239.0' y='211.7' font-size='10'>6</text><line x1='48.7' y1='129.4' x2='54.7' y2='129.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='35.7' y='133.4' font-size='10'>10</text><line x1='48.7' y1='61.0' x2='54.7' y2='61.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='35.7' y='65.0' font-size='10'>20</text></svg></div>\\[A=\\int_0^{3a}\\bigl[2ax-(x^2-ax)\\bigr]dx=\\int_0^{3a}(3ax-x^2)\\,dx=\\Bigl[\\frac{3a}2x^2-\\frac{x^3}3\\Bigr]_0^{3a}=\\frac{27a^3}2-9a^3=\\frac{9a^3}2\\]\\[\\frac{9a^3}2=36\\iff a^3=8\\iff a=2\\]<div class='res'>\\(a=2\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"integ","tipo":"area","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2019-RESERVA_3.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2019-reserva-3-3","n":3,"num":3,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Dada la matriz \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}5&4&3\\\\4&2&2\\\\3&2&1\\end{pmatrix}\\), halla la matriz \\(X\\) que cumple \\(AX=(A^{-1}A^t+I)^2\\), siendo \\(A^t\\) la matriz traspuesta de \\(A\\) e \\(I\\) la matriz identidad de orden 3.","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(A\\) es simétrica: \\(A^t=A\\). Por tanto, si existe \\(A^{-1}\\), \\(A^{-1}A^t=A^{-1}A=I\\) y</p>\\[(A^{-1}A^t+I)^2=(I+I)^2=(2I)^2=4I\\]<p>\\(A\\) tiene inversa si y solo si \\(|A|\\neq0\\). Lo calculo por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}5&4&3\\\\4&2&2\\\\3&2&1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(10+24+24\\bigr)-\\bigl(18+20+16\\bigr)\\]\\[=4\\neq0\\]<p>Existe \\(A^{-1}\\). La ecuación queda \\(AX=4I\\iff X=4A^{-1}\\). Con \\(A^{-1}=\\dfrac1{|A|}(\\operatorname{Adj}A)^t\\):</p>\\[\\operatorname{Adj}A=\\begin{pmatrix}-2&2&2\\\\2&-4&2\\\\2&2&-6\\end{pmatrix}\\ \\Rightarrow\\ A^{-1}=\\frac14\\begin{pmatrix}-2&2&2\\\\2&-4&2\\\\2&2&-6\\end{pmatrix}\\]\\[X=4A^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}-2&2&2\\\\2&-4&2\\\\2&2&-6\\end{pmatrix}\\]<div class='res'>\\(X=\\begin{pmatrix}-2&2&2\\\\2&-4&2\\\\2&2&-6\\end{pmatrix}\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: \\(AX=4I\\) ✓.</i></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"inv","apartados":""},{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"ecmat","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2019-RESERVA_3.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2019-reserva-3-4","n":4,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Considera la recta \\(r\\equiv\\begin{cases}x+y+2=0\\\\-y+z+5=0\\end{cases}\\) y el plano \\(\\pi\\equiv2x+y-mz=1\\).","apartados":["(1,25 p.) Calcula \\(m\\) sabiendo que \\(r\\) y \\(\\pi\\) son paralelos.","(1,25 p.) Para \\(m=-1\\), calcula la distancia entre \\(r\\) y \\(\\pi\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p><b>Paramétricas de </b>\\(r\\)<b>.</b> Con \\(y=t\\): \\(x=-2-t\\), \\(z=t-5\\):</p>\\[r\\equiv\\begin{cases}x=-2-t\\\\y=t\\\\z=-5+t\\end{cases}\\qquad R(-2,0,-5),\\ \\vec d=(-1,1,1)\\]<p>\\(r\\) es paralela a \\(\\pi\\) si \\(\\vec d\\perp\\vec n=(2,1,-m)\\):</p>\\[\\vec d\\cdot\\vec n=-2+1-m=0\\iff m=-1\\]<p>Con \\(m=-1\\), \\(R\\) no está en \\(\\pi\\): \\(-4+0-5=-9\\neq1\\). Así que la recta no está contenida en el plano.</p><div class='res'>\\(m=-1\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(m=-1\\), \\(\\pi\\equiv2x+y+z-1=0\\) y la recta es paralela al plano: la distancia es la de cualquier punto de \\(r\\), por ejemplo \\(R\\), a \\(\\pi\\), es decir, la distancia de \\(R\\) a su proyección ortogonal \\(M\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>El camino más corto de un punto a un plano es el segmento perpendicular al plano.</i>.</p><p><b>Paso 1. Recta perpendicular a </b>\\(\\pi\\)<b> por </b>\\(R\\)<b>.</b> Como la recta y el plano son perpendiculares, el normal \\((2,1,1)\\) es su director: \\((-2+2\\lambda,\\,\\lambda,\\,-5+\\lambda)\\).</p><p><b>Paso 2. Punto de corte.</b></p>\\[2(-2+2\\lambda)+\\lambda+(-5+\\lambda)-1=0\\iff6\\lambda-10=0\\iff\\lambda=\\frac53\\Rightarrow M\\left(\\frac43,\\,\\frac53,\\,-\\frac{10}3\\right)\\]<p><b>Paso 3. Distancia.</b></p>\\[d(r,\\pi)=|\\overrightarrow{RM}|=\\frac53|(2,1,1)|=\\frac{5\\sqrt6}3\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":96,\"el\":21,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[4.026,-0.178,-6.875],[-1.359,5.208,-1.489],[-1.359,3.511,0.208],[4.026,-1.875,-5.178]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[-1.359,3.511,0.208],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[0.2,-2.2,-7.2],[-4.2,2.2,-2.8],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[-4.2,2.2,-2.8],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[-3.0,1.0,-4.0],[-3.52,1.52,-3.48],\"#16a34a\",\"d\",4,-4],[\"line\",[-2,0,-5],[1.333,1.667,-3.333],\"#16a34a\",2.0,true],[\"line\",[1.007,1.503,-3.497],[0.776,1.734,-3.266],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[0.776,1.734,-3.266],[1.102,1.898,-3.102],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"pt\",[-2,0,-5],\"R\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[1.333,1.667,-3.333],\"M\",8,12]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 257' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m19r3a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m19r3a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m19r3a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m19r3a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='26.0,203.0 200.0,97.5 206.5,18.0 32.4,123.5' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='210.5' y='18.0' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><line x1='171.8' y1='193.1' x2='314.0' y2='106.9' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='320.0' y='106.9' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='275.2' y1='130.4' x2='292.0' y2='120.2' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m19r3a4d)'/><text x='296.0' y='116.2' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700'>d</text><line x1='242.9' y1='150.0' x2='116.2' y2='110.5' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.0' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><line x1='128.6' y1='114.4' x2='136.1' y2='109.8' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='136.1' y1='109.8' x2='123.7' y2='106.0' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><circle cx='242.9' cy='150.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='249.9' y='144.0' font-weight='700'>R</text><circle cx='116.2' cy='110.5' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='124.2' y='122.5' font-weight='700'>M</text><line x1='24' y1='227' x2='8.1' y2='226.4' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='-0.5' y='230.2' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='227' x2='22.3' y2='232.7' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='18.7' y='238.7' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='227' x2='24.0' y2='212.1' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='210.8' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,249)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,249)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,249)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(260.5,249)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(d(r,\\pi)=\\dfrac{5\\sqrt6}3\\approx4{,}082\\) unidades</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación con la fórmula: \\(\\frac{|-4+0-5-1|}{\\sqrt6}=\\frac{10}{\\sqrt6}=\\frac{5\\sqrt6}3\\) ✓.</i></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"geom","tipo":"pos","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"geom","tipo":"dist","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2019-RESERVA_3.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2019-reserva-3-5","n":5,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Dada \\(f:(1,e)\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=\\dfrac1x+\\ln(x)\\) (\\(\\ln\\) denota la función logaritmo neperiano), determina la recta tangente a la gráfica de \\(f\\) que tiene pendiente máxima.","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>La pendiente de la tangente en \\(x\\) es \\(f'(x)\\):</p>\\[p(x)=f'(x)=-\\frac1{x^2}+\\frac1x,\\qquad x\\in(1,e)\\]<p>Busco el máximo de \\(p\\) en \\((1,e)\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Rayamos la parte de la recta que queda fuera del dominio: ahí la función no está definida y no se estudia.</i>; no hay puntos «problemáticos» (\\(x\\gt1\\)). Estudiamos el signo de \\(p'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>.</p>\\[p'(x)=\\frac2{x^3}-\\frac1{x^2}=\\frac{2-x}{x^3}\\]\\[2-x=0\\Rightarrow\\boxed{x=2}\\in(1,e)\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 228 108' width='100%' style='max-width:274px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H214' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M14 56L18 48M18 56L22 48M22 56L26 48M26 56L30 48M30 56L34 48M34 56L38 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M190 56L194 48M194 56L198 48M198 56L202 48M202 56L206 48M206 56L210 48M210 56L214 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M40 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='40' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>1</text><path d='M114 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='114' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>2</text><path d='M188 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='188' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>e</text><text x='51.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M65.0 40L101.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M92.0 11L101.0 10L99.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='77.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>p</tspan>′(1,5) &gt; 0</text><text x='125.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M139.0 10L175.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M166.0 39L175.0 40L173.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='151.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>p</tspan>′(2,5) &lt; 0</text></svg></div><p>Luego \\(p\\) crece en \\((1,2)\\) debido a que \\(p'(x)\\gt0\\), y decrece en \\((2,e)\\) debido a que \\(p'(x)\\lt0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>. Alcanza un máximo en \\(x=2\\) de valor \\(p(2)=-\\frac14+\\frac12=\\frac14\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Hay un mínimo donde \\(f\\) pasa de decrecer a crecer y un máximo donde pasa de crecer a decrecer.</i>.</p><p>La tangente pasa por \\((2,f(2))=\\left(2,\\frac12+\\ln2\\right)\\) con pendiente \\(\\frac14\\):</p>\\[y-\\left(\\frac12+\\ln2\\right)=\\frac14(x-2)\\iff y=\\frac x4+\\ln2\\]<div class='res'>\\(y=\\dfrac x4+\\ln2\\) (en el punto de abscisa \\(x=2\\))</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"tang","apartados":""},{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"opt","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2019-RESERVA_3.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2019-reserva-3-6","n":6,"num":2,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sea \\(f:\\left[0,\\frac\\pi6\\right]\\to\\mathbb R\\) una función continua y sea \\(F\\) la primitiva de \\(f\\) que cumple \\(F(0)=\\frac\\pi3\\) y \\(F\\left(\\frac\\pi6\\right)=\\pi\\). Calcula:","apartados":["(1 p.) \\(\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\pi/6}\\bigl(3f(x)-\\cos(x)\\bigr)dx\\)","(1,5 p.) \\(\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\pi/6}\\mathrm{sen}\\bigl(F(x)\\bigr)f(x)\\,dx\\)"]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Por la regla de Barrow, como \\(F\\) es una primitiva de \\(f\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Barrow: si \\(F\\) es una primitiva de \\(f\\) continua en \\([a,b]\\), \\(\\int_a^bf(x)\\,dx=F(b)-F(a)\\).</i>:</p>\\[\\int_0^{\\pi/6}\\bigl(3f(x)-\\cos x\\bigr)dx=3\\Bigl[F(x)\\Bigr]_0^{\\pi/6}-\\Bigl[\\mathrm{sen}\\,x\\Bigr]_0^{\\pi/6}=3\\left(\\pi-\\frac\\pi3\\right)-\\frac12=2\\pi-\\frac12\\]<div class='res'>\\(2\\pi-\\dfrac12\\approx5{,}783\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Como \\(F'=f\\), el integrando es de la forma \\(\\mathrm{sen}(F(x))\\,F'(x)\\), cuya primitiva es \\(-\\cos(F(x))\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Regla de la cadena: \\(\\bigl(-\\cos F(x)\\bigr)'=\\mathrm{sen}(F(x))\\,F'(x)\\).</i>:</p>\\[\\int_0^{\\pi/6}\\mathrm{sen}\\bigl(F(x)\\bigr)f(x)\\,dx=\\Bigl[-\\cos F(x)\\Bigr]_0^{\\pi/6}=-\\cos\\pi+\\cos\\frac\\pi3=1+\\frac12=\\frac32\\]<div class='res'>\\(\\dfrac32\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"integ","tipo":"def","apartados":"a, b"},{"tema":"integ","tipo":"cambio","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2019-RESERVA_3.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2019-reserva-3-7","n":7,"num":3,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Considera el siguiente sistema de ecuaciones lineales \\[\\begin{cases}x+\\lambda y+z=4\\\\-\\lambda x+y+z=1\\\\x+y+z=\\lambda+3\\end{cases}\\]","apartados":["(1,5 p.) Discute el sistema según los valores de \\(\\lambda\\).","(1 p.) Resuelve el sistema, si es posible, para \\(\\lambda=1\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&\\lambda&1\\\\-\\lambda&1&1\\\\1&1&1\\end{pmatrix}\\qquad A^*=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1&\\lambda&1&4\\\\-\\lambda&1&1&1\\\\1&1&1&\\lambda+3\\end{array}\\right)\\]<p>Uso el teorema de Rouché-Frobenius<i class='n' data-t='th'>Rouché-Frobenius: compatible si y solo si \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\); determinado si ese rango es el número de incógnitas.</i>. Calculo \\(|A|\\) por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&\\lambda&1\\\\-\\lambda&1&1\\\\1&1&1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(1+\\lambda- \\lambda\\bigr)-\\bigl(1+1- \\lambda^{2}\\bigr)\\]\\[=\\lambda^2-1\\]\\[\\lambda^2-1=0\\iff\\boxed{\\lambda=1}\\ \\text{ o }\\ \\boxed{\\lambda=-1}\\]<p><b>• Si </b>\\(\\lambda\\neq\\pm1\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=3=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\). <b>Sistema compatible determinado.</b></p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(\\lambda=1\\)<b>:</b> \\(A^*=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1&1&1&4\\\\-1&1&1&1\\\\1&1&1&4\\end{array}\\right)\\). El menor \\(\\begin{vmatrix}1&1\\\\-1&1\\end{vmatrix}=2\\neq0\\): \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=2\\). La tercera fila de \\(A^*\\) es igual a la primera, así que el rango de \\(A^*\\) es el de sus dos primeras filas: \\(\\operatorname{rg}A^*=2\\). <b>Sistema compatible indeterminado.</b></p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(\\lambda=-1\\)<b>:</b> \\(A^*=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1&-1&1&4\\\\1&1&1&1\\\\1&1&1&2\\end{array}\\right)\\). El menor \\(\\begin{vmatrix}1&-1\\\\1&1\\end{vmatrix}=2\\neq0\\): \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=2\\). Menor de \\(A^*\\) de las columnas 1, 2 y 4:</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}1&-1&4\\\\1&1&1\\\\1&1&2\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(2-1+4\\bigr)-\\bigl(4+1-2\\bigr)\\]\\[=2\\neq0\\]<p>\\(\\operatorname{rg}A^*=3\\neq\\operatorname{rg}A\\). <b>Sistema incompatible.</b></p><div class='res'>Si \\(\\lambda\\neq\\pm1\\): compatible determinado. Si \\(\\lambda=1\\): compatible indeterminado. Si \\(\\lambda=-1\\): incompatible</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(\\lambda=1\\), las dos primeras ecuaciones son independientes (contienen el menor no nulo) y la tercera, igual a la primera, depende de ellas: la elimino. Tomo \\(z=t\\):</p>\\[\\begin{cases}x+y=4-t\\\\-x+y=1-t\\end{cases}\\]<p>Lo resuelvo por la regla de Cramer<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Cramer: si \\(|A|\\neq0\\), cada incógnita es el cociente entre el determinante que resulta de sustituir su columna por la de los términos independientes y el determinante \\(|A|\\) de la matriz de coeficientes.</i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&1\\\\-1&1\\end{vmatrix}=2\\]\\[x=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}4 - t&1\\\\1 - t&1\\end{vmatrix}}{2}=\\frac{3}{2}\\]\\[y=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}1&4 - t\\\\-1&1 - t\\end{vmatrix}}{2}=\\frac{5 - 2 t}{2}=\\frac{5}{2} - t\\]<div class='res'>\\(x=\\dfrac32,\\ y=\\dfrac52-t,\\ z=t\\), con \\(t\\in\\mathbb R\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"sistemas","tipo":"disc","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"sistemas","tipo":"res","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2019-RESERVA_3.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2019-reserva-3-8","n":8,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Halla cada uno de los puntos de la recta \\(r\\equiv\\begin{cases}x-y=0\\\\y-z=0\\end{cases}\\) de manera que junto con los puntos \\(A(1,1,0)\\), \\(B(1,0,1)\\) y \\(C(0,1,1)\\) formen un tetraedro de volumen \\(\\frac56\\).","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\equiv x=y=z\\): un punto genérico es \\(X(s,s,s)\\). El volumen del tetraedro es la sexta parte del valor absoluto del producto mixto<i class='n' data-t='th'>\\(V=\\frac16\\bigl|[\\vec u,\\vec v,\\vec w]\\bigr|\\): el producto mixto da el volumen del paralelepípedo y el tetraedro es la sexta parte.</i>:</p>\\[\\overrightarrow{AB}=(0,-1,1)\\qquad\\overrightarrow{AC}=(-1,0,1)\\qquad\\overrightarrow{AX}=(s-1,\\,s-1,\\,s)\\]<p>Lo calculo por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[[\\overrightarrow{AB},\\overrightarrow{AC},\\overrightarrow{AX}]=\\begin{vmatrix}0&-1&1\\\\-1&0&1\\\\s-1&s-1&s\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(0+1 - s+1 - s\\bigr)-\\bigl(0+0+s\\bigr)\\]\\[=-3s+2\\]\\[V=\\frac16|2-3s|=\\frac56\\iff|2-3s|=5\\]<p>• \\(2-3s=5\\iff s=-1\\Rightarrow X_1(-1,-1,-1)\\).</p><p>• \\(2-3s=-5\\iff s=\\frac73\\Rightarrow X_2\\left(\\frac73,\\frac73,\\frac73\\right)\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-10,\"el\":18,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[1,1,0],[1,0,1],[0,1,1]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"line\",[-1.5,-1.5,-1.5],[2.6,2.6,2.6],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[2.6,2.6,2.6],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[-1,-1,-1],[1,1,0],\"#64748b\",1.3,true],[\"line\",[-1,-1,-1],[1,0,1],\"#64748b\",1.3,true],[\"line\",[-1,-1,-1],[0,1,1],\"#64748b\",1.3,true],[\"line\",[2.333,2.333,2.333],[1,1,0],\"#64748b\",1.3,true],[\"line\",[2.333,2.333,2.333],[1,0,1],\"#64748b\",1.3,true],[\"line\",[2.333,2.333,2.333],[0,1,1],\"#64748b\",1.3,true],[\"pt\",[1,1,0],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[1,0,1],\"B\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,1,1],\"C\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-1,-1,-1],\"X₁\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[2.333,2.333,2.333],\"X₂\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 246' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m19r3b4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m19r3b4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m19r3b4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m19r3b4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='201.6,143.6 141.9,89.2 191.1,67.5' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='2